      "Place": "Cold steppe",
      "Area": "Test Den",
      "LocationId": 20369,
      "Actor": "Gaios the Fair",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I observe the grey wolf pacing at the tree-line, its head low and eyes fixed upon something unseen. While I do not perceive any immediate task, my rank commands a haughty glance, and I shall turn my attention to the steward\u0027s quarters, where a proper cup of cold milk awaits.",
